 are silent. They are still. But they are watching.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/1a83c0cfd51e063e5e7269739f135d14.poster.avif?t=1765814855\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/1a83c0cfd51e063e5e7269739f135d14.webm?t=1765814855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/1a83c0cfd51e063e5e7269739f135d14.mp4?t=1765814855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONFESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You brought four &quot;sinners&quot; here to make them confess. But in the darkness, the roles have changed. Are you the judge, or are you the prisoner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pestilence</strong> focuses on atmosphere, narrative, and tension rather than cheap jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Telling.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey So far:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is an early Alpha. We have already implemented major improvements based on your feedback. Join our Discord to see the latest progress.</p>","developers":["Kooky Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/7171f9226f9f58e08f90a1b6ace9fc2a03d8ebbd/header.jpg?t=1765814855","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><